stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Connecting: connect()
    Connecting --> Connected: success
    Connecting --> Error: timeout
    Connecting --> Idle: cancel

    Connected --> Processing: send()
    Connected --> Idle: disconnect()

    Processing --> Connected: response
    Processing --> Error: timeout
    Processing --> Connected: retry

    Error --> Idle: reset()
    Error --> Connecting: reconnect()

    Idle --> [*]: destroy()
